18
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:47,000
Now, Baden Powell, as a boy, had sailed in Pool Harbor near Brown Sea with his brothers

19
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:50,000
and he knew the island and they'd even landed on it before,

20
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:56,000
And he became convinced that Brown Sea would make the ideal location for his first camping experiment.

21
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:01,000
It was isolated, but it wasn't too far away from civilization to get provisions,

22
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:06,000
And so he sent a letter to Charles Van Routt and asked for permission to use the island,

23
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:09,000
and it produced an immediate response. of course he could,

24
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:12,000
And the rest is history, as they say.

